{"id":54,"group":"special","facts_text":"意大利总公司乙在法国里昂设有分支机构；甲就与该分支机构签订的维修合同在里昂法院起诉乙。","connecting_factors":{"branch_agency_establishment":true,"establishment_place":"France","defendant_domicile":"Italy"},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"France courts (branch establishment)","forum_type":"special","reasoning":"争议源自对里昂分支机构经营活动的合同，甲可依 Art.7(5) 在分支机构所在地法国法院起诉，即使总公司住所在意大利。","missing_facts":[],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:7(5)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.7(5)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art7-5","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
{"id":55,"group":"appearance","facts_text":"甲在葡萄牙法院起诉德国被告乙，案件与葡萄牙并无连接点；乙仅为提出管辖异议而出庭，未就实体进行答辩。","connecting_factors":{"appearance":true,"appearance_purpose":"contest_jurisdiction"},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","reasoning":"依 Art.26(1) 单纯为抗辩管辖而出庭不视为接受法院管辖，葡萄牙法院仍须依据其他条款判断有无连接点，信息不足时应拒答。","missing_facts":[],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:26(1)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.26(1)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art26-1","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
{"id":56,"group":"appearance_vs_exclusive","facts_text":"德国法院受理关于法国不动产物权的争议，乙出庭并对实体答辩未提管辖异议。","connecting_factors":{"subject_matter":"rights_in_rem_in_immovable_property","property_location":"France","appearance":true,"exclusive_matter":true},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","reasoning":"不动产物权属于 Art.24(1) 专属管辖事项，出庭不得突破专属规则；德国法院是否应移送或驳回涉及复杂问题，此处以拒答表示不得据出庭确立对法国不动产的管辖。","missing_facts":[],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:24(1)","span:26(1)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.24(1)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art24-1","granularity":"paragraph"},{"provision":"Art.26(1)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art26-1","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
{"id":57,"group":"appearance_protected_party","facts_text":"德国法院受理企业商家甲诉法国消费者乙的消费合同纠纷；乙在收到起诉状时被书面告知有权对管辖提出异议及其后果，仍到庭就实体进行答辩。","connecting_factors":{"protected_category":"consumer","appearance":true,"appearance_purpose":"on_the_merits","court":"Germany","consumer_domicile":"France","informed_of_rights":true},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"Germany courts (appearance, informed consumer)","forum_type":"appearance","reasoning":"在消费者案件中，只有在法院证明消费者已被充分告知其对管辖提出异议的权利并仍选择就实体答辩时，Art.26(2) 方允许以出庭确立管辖，本案条件满足，德国法院可行使管辖。","missing_facts":[],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:26(2)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.26(2)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art26-2","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
{"id":58,"group":"appearance","facts_text":"西班牙法院受理甲诉乙之债务纠纷，乙完全缺席；法院查明起诉状已依欧盟送达规则妥为送达。","connecting_factors":{"default_of_appearance":true,"service_of_process_status":"proper"},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Court_of_X_has_jurisdiction","forum":"Spain courts (default after proper service)","forum_type":"appearance","reasoning":"依据 Art.26(1) 在缺席情况下，法院需先确认自身管辖并确认文书已适当送达；既已证明送达适当且无明显管辖瑕疵，可继续缺席审理并作出判决。","missing_facts":[],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:26(1)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.26(1)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art26-1","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
{"id":59,"group":"appearance_vs_exclusive","facts_text":"意大利法院受理请求宣告德国注册商标无效之诉；被告出庭对实体答辩未提管辖异议。","connecting_factors":{"subject_matter":"ip_registration_or_validity","ip_register_state":"Germany","appearance":true,"exclusive_matter":true},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","reasoning":"工业产权注册有效性原则上由登记国法院专属管辖，意大利法院即便因被告出庭也不能突破 Art.24(4) 的专属规则，此处以拒答体现不得据出庭确认其管辖。","missing_facts":[],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:24(4)","span:26(1)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.24(4)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art24-4","granularity":"paragraph"},{"provision":"Art.26(1)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art26-1","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
{"id":60,"group":"appearance_protected_party","facts_text":"爱尔兰法院受理雇主甲对法国雇员乙的劳动合同争议；乙到庭就实体答辩，但卷宗中未见法院曾告知其可对管辖提出异议。","connecting_factors":{"protected_category":"employee","appearance":true,"appearance_purpose":"on_the_merits","court":"Ireland","consumer_domicile":"France","informed_of_rights":false},"expected_output":{"conclusion":"Abstain_Insufficient_Info","forum":"none","forum_type":"none","reasoning":"在受保护一方（例如雇员）的案件中，Art.26(2) 要求法院在依据出庭确立管辖前确保已告知其可对管辖提出异议；本案未能证明已履行告知义务，信息不足以确认爱尔兰法院的管辖，故作拒答处理。","missing_facts":["notification_of_right_to_contest"],"trace":{"evidence_ids":["span:26(2)"],"decode_run":"hardcoded_gold"},"legal_basis":[{"provision":"Art.26(2)","eli":"eli:reg_1215_2012#art26-2","granularity":"paragraph"}]},"notes":"","t_eval":null}
